			SUBSEC 5.3
				Information regarding Grievance Redressal Mechanism{{^{{FOOTNOTE 39}}}}
				FOOTNOTE 39
					Circular No. CIR/MIRSD/3/2014 dated August 28, 2014
				PARA 5.3.1.
					For information of all investors who deal/ invest/ transact in the market, it has now been decided that the information as provided below shall be prominently displayed in the offices of the CRAs:
